{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>The restitution assigned to HaShem.</b> For when the owners are no longer alive, it is fitting to restore the stolen property to the owners of its owners — and that is the blessed El — as our Rabbis of blessed memory said (Bava Metzi'a, chapter HaMafqid): מֵת הָעֶבֶד, יַחֲזִיר לָרַבּוֹ, 'if the slave has died, he restores it to the master.'"], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:38:39.836821013Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}